--- text
Confirm your subscription

This address, [EMAIL_ADDRESS], was entered on a signup form for
[PRODUCT_NAME]. Confirm that the address is yours and [LIST_NAME]
will start arriving. Until then nothing is sent to this address.

[LIST_NAME] is sent [SEND_FREQUENCY]. That is the whole of it: this
link adds the address to that one list and nothing else.

Confirm your subscription:

[CTA_URL]

This link expires at [EXPIRY_ABSOLUTE] - [EXPIRY_RELATIVE] after it
was sent. After that, enter the address on the form again to get a
new link.

If you did not sign up, you need do nothing at all. No further
email will arrive, and the address is discarded.

If anything here looks wrong, reply to this email, or write to
[SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
